{"id":"n24489-1-3","stage":2,"title":"아래층 · 楼下","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24489-1-3-1","ko":"실례지만 매점이 어디에 있나요?","zh":"打扰一下，小卖部在哪儿呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"실례지만","meaning":"实例","explanation":"실례：实例；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；지만：表示转折或让步：“但是、虽然”。","readings":[{"term":"실례","audio":"/audio/a093e7a78337b547c773.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78457","senseId":"1","lemma":"실례","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"실례지만","audio":"/audio/3efe88baa668f1b42f8b.mp3"}},{"text":"매점이","meaning":"小卖部，小卖店，小铺","explanation":"매점：小卖部，小卖店，小铺；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"매점","audio":"/audio/5d59d0d1ae45fc3611b0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55725","senseId":"1","lemma":"매점","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"매점이","audio":"/audio/a2003d179ba453e61677.mp3"}},{"text":"어디에","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디에","audio":"/audio/c24ae324e24a5ebc5c5e.mp3"}},{"text":"있나요?","meaning":"在","explanation":"있다：在；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"8","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있나요","audio":"/audio/0eb260e471116d837abb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a093e7a78337b547","term":"실례","zh":"实例","audio":"/audio/a093e7a78337b547c773.mp3","entryId":"78457","definition":"具体的真实例子。","pronunciation":["실례"]},{"id":"5d59d0d1ae45fc36","term":"매점","zh":"小卖部，小卖店，小铺","audio":"/audio/5d59d0d1ae45fc3611b0.mp3","entryId":"55725","definition":"设在某机构或设施内而出售商品的小商店。","pronunciation":["매ː점"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"在","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"某物占有某处位置或空间。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/44163f3d3e2ad74c2db9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24489-1-3-2","ko":"아래층에 있습니다.","zh":"在楼下。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아래층에","meaning":"楼下","explanation":"아래층：楼下；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"아래층","audio":"/audio/5539ea7954881cbca8c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24489","senseId":"1","lemma":"아래층","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아래층에","audio":"/audio/d48a23fff63d992c25de.mp3"}},{"text":"있습니다.","meaning":"在，待，住","explanation":"있다：在，待，住；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"9","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있습니다","audio":"/audio/de7385b84e32dd836700.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5539ea7954881cbc","term":"아래층","zh":"楼下","audio":"/audio/5539ea7954881cbca8c1.mp3","entryId":"24489","definition":"比某一层低的楼层。","pronunciation":["아래층","아랟층"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"在，待，住","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物停留或居住在某个地方。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/55cd01f8077b7cea9231.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.02,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=24489","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":69,"sequenceScore":1.8467,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["在楼下。","打扰一下，小卖部在哪儿呢？","为什么公交车费多扣了100韩元啊？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["打扰一下，小卖部在哪儿呢？","为什么公交车费多扣了100韩元啊？","在楼下。"],"answer":2}]}
